            "review_title": "Review at Bánh Canh Miền Trung - Bánh Canh Ngố",
            "review_text": "Petitgiaco\nChambery, France477 contributions\n0\nFor a small appetite or a soup for breakfast.\nAug 2026 • Friends\nAverage. The menu photos do not reflect reality. They were taken without the soup broth, so the ingredients appear huge and plentiful. Small restaurant in a nice neighborhood.\nClean, brand new with professional staff who speak good English. It's okay for a small appetite or a breakfast before having a very good coffee at the coffee shop, Saveur Cafe, right next door\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten August 31, 2026",
